data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_2_464d6520-6ab4-4269-829d-df37a5983d85","delta":"Your Maple Checking is currently at $9,412.20, comfortably above the threshold. I'll set up the daily check now."}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_2_464d6520-6ab4-4269-829d-df37a5983d85","delta":"Done. Every morning around 7:53, I'll check your Maple Checking balance and notify you only if it has dropped below $2,000 — otherwise you'll hear nothing. Right now it's at $9,412.20, so no alert today.\n\nOne limit to flag: this recurring check automatically expires after 7 days. Closer to then, just ask me to renew it and I'll set it up again."}

